UPDATE companies SET description='Custom Wire Industries, Inc. has operated from Muskego, Wisconsin since its founding in 1968. The company began as a manufacturer of electrical wire and cable assemblies and has since expanded into a range of electromechanical fabrication services.

The company produces custom wire harnesses, cable assemblies, ribbon cables, overmolded components, lead wires, electromechanical devices, kits, control panels, and power transmission assemblies. Its capabilities include cable fabrication, wire harness assembly, electromechanical assembly, custom tooling, injection molding, overmolding, CAD-based design, and turnkey kitted assemblies. Custom Wire Industries handles projects from microscopic components to 900-pound alert tower assemblies.

Customers span medical, military, industrial, telecommunications, and automotive sectors. The firm fabricates cables for medical equipment, military-spec power cable systems, industrial machinery, and automotive wire harnesses.

Custom Wire Industries emphasizes affordable pricing, fast turnaround times, and a 100% quality management system with strict quality control at each manufacturing stage. All components meet or exceed UL and CSA regulations. The company also offers design services, allowing clients to consolidate components and reduce shipping and labor costs.', certifications=ARRAY['UL','CSA']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Cable fabrication", "Wire harness assembly", "Electromechanical assembly", "Control panel manufacturing", "Power cable assembly", "Overmolding", "Injection molding", "Custom tooling", "CAD design", "Turnkey assembly", "Kitting", "Sensor cable manufacturing", "Ribbon cable manufacturing", "Lead wire manufacturing", "Coax cable assembly", "Fiber optic cable assembly", "Medical cable assembly", "Industrial assembly", "Mechanical cable assembly", "Assembly kit fabrication", "Custom electrical component manufacturing"], "industries": ["Medical", "Military", "Industrial", "Telecommunications", "Automotive"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["UL and CSA certified manufacturing", "Fast turnaround times on custom assemblies", "Affordable pricing with consolidated component sourcing", "100% quality management with strict in-process controls", "CAD design and custom tooling with injection molding capabilities"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1968 -> db, page /", "Headquarters Muskego, Wisconsin -> db, page /", "UL and CSA certified -> page /", "Manufactures electrical wire and cable assemblies -> page /", "Produces custom wire harnesses, cable assemblies, ribbon cables, overmolding, lead wires, electromechanical devices, kits, control panels, power transmission assemblies, sensor cables -> page /", "Capabilities: cable fabrication, wire harness assembly, electromechanical assembly, custom tooling, injection molding, overmolding, CAD design, turnkey kitted assemblies -> page /", "Scale: microscopic sizes up to 9