software -> /services", "Offers maintenance and calibration services at customer plants -> /services", "Provides training and seminars on testing technologies -> /services", "Testing systems operating 24/7 worldwide -> /services", "Seminars held in Canada and international locations -> /services"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "D&V designs and manufactures state-of-the-art Performance, Endurance, and Production testing systems", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='d-v-electronics' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='D.W. Woodcraft, Inc. was founded in 1983 by David and Julie Rust Posey in Ava, Missouri.

The company specializes in custom woodworking, producing kitchen cabinets, bathroom vanities, entertainment centers, bookshelves, desks, armoires, and other built-in furniture. In 1990 Posey adopted a computer-aided design and estimating system that generates cut lists for cabinet components. The operation moved to a larger facility on Highway 5 South in 1992–1993, where at its peak the shop employed nine craftsmen. Today the firm operates a showroom on Shull Street where clients can view materials and discuss projects.

D.W. Woodcraft serves residential homeowners, builders, and remodelers in the Ava, Missouri area and surrounding communities. Projects range from full kitchen remodels with features such as lazy susans, custom islands with overhead storage, and integrated pantries, to bathroom vanities with double sinks and decorative wooden tub surrounds. The company also creates freestanding entertainment centers, bookshelves, and custom furniture pieces for residential spaces.

The Poseys started the business to bring personalized, handcrafted cabinetry to local homes, emphasizing direct collaboration with clients to achieve a "wow factor" in each piece. The company highlights its design-to-build approach, free estimates, and a showroom that allows customers to select materials in person.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cabinet design", "Kitchen cabinet manufacturing", "Bathroom vanity manufacturing", "Entertainment center construction", "Custom furniture making (bookshelves, desks, armoires)", "Computer-aided design (CAD) and estimating", "Cut list generation", "Showroom material consultation", "Free project estimates"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Kitchen and bath remodeling", "Custom furniture manufacturing"], "materials": ["Wood", "Mahogany", "Maple", "Hardwoods"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Free estimates on all projects", "Largest showroom in the area for material selection", "Computer-aided design and cut-list generation since 1990", "Family-owned and operated since 1983", "Custom design-to-build for kitchens, baths, and furniture"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1983 by David & Julie Rust Posey -> /about-us", "Started in mother''s basement early 1980s -> /about-us", "First shop built 1985 on NE 2nd Ave -> /about-us", "Expanded to kitchen/bath cabinets 1985 -> /about-us", "Adopted computer design/estimating program 1990 -> /about-us", "Moved to Highway 5 South facility 1992-1993 -> /about-us", "Peak employment of nine craftsmen -> /about-us", "Son Daniel Posey worked in shop -> /about-us", "Custom kitchen cabinets, bathroom cabinets, entertainment centers -> /", "Free estimates offered -> /", "Largest showroom in area -> /", "Custom features: lazy susans, islands with overheads, pantries -> /services", "Bathroom vanities with double sinks, tub surrounds -> /services", "Bookshelves, desks, armoires, custom furniture -> /services", "Mat