UPDATE companies SET description='D3 Performance is based in League City, Texas. The company does not publicly disclose its founding year, ownership structure, or founders.

The company develops and sells performance tuning hardware and software for Toyota and Lexus vehicles. D3 also provides custom tune files and E85 conversion add-ons for supported models.

D3 serves the automotive aftermarket, targeting owners and shops working on late-model Toyota and Lexus platforms. The company also supports the 2AR-FE four-cylinder in the Camry and Scion tC.

D3 emphasizes several differentiators: real wide-open-throttle fuel control for increased boost and aggressive timing, sustained higher commanded boost across the rev range, and removal of throttle-closure torque limits and speed limiters. The company backs its hardware with a 30-day money-back guarantee and offers phone and email support during Central Time business hours.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO9001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["OBD2 programming", "Custom ECU tuning", "Performance tuner hardware development", "Pro Tuner software development", "Supercharger kit integration", "Harrop supercharger kit distribution", "E85 conversion tuning", "Cold air intake tuning"], "industries": ["Automotive"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Real WOT commanded fuel control for increased boost and aggressive timing", "Higher commanded boost sustained throughout the entire rev range", "Elimination of throttle closure from torque limits and removal of all speed limiters", "30-day money-back guarantee on hardware", "Phone and email support Monday\u2013Friday 9:00 AM\u20135:00 PM CST"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in League City, Texas -> db", "ISO9001 certification -> db", "Offers Performance Tuners, Pro Tuner Software, Superchargers, Custom Tunes, OBD2 Programmer -> db", "Serves Automotive industry -> db", "Sells OBD2 programmers for Toyota Tundra, Tacoma, Camry, Lexus models -> pages \"/\"", "Offers Harrop supercharger kits for 3rd Gen Tacoma and 2GR-FE engines -> pages \"/\"", "Provides custom tunes and E85 tune add-ons -> pages \"/\"", "30 Day Money Back Guarantee -> pages \"/\"", "Support via Phone or Email Monday-Friday 9-5 CST -> pages \"/\"", "Claims Total Fuel Control, higher boost, no throttle closure restrictions -> pages \"/\""], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Performance Tuners, Pro Tuner Software, Superchargers, Custom Tunes, OBD2 Programmer", "found