UPDATE companies SET description='Delaney Manufacturing Services LLC has operated from Bradenton, Florida since 1976. The company provides plastic injection molding and full-service product development, offering capabilities that span CAD design, prototyping, tooling, production, assembly, and packaging under one roof.

The shop runs plastic injection molding for volumes ranging from a single piece to millions of parts, with no minimum or maximum order requirements. Services include 3D printing for rapid prototypes, renderings and animations for design validation, and metal-to-plastic conversion programs that replace machined components with engineered resins. All work is performed in-house at the Bradenton facility.

Customers come from consumer goods, medical, military, and industrial sectors, as well as other manufacturers needing component production. The company also works directly with inventors and entrepreneurs to develop new products from concept through retail-ready packaging and drop shipping.

Delaney Manufacturing differentiates itself by consolidating every step — CAD, mold making, molding, assembly, packaging, and logistics — in a single location. It promises same-business-day quote responses, provides a downloadable NDA, and imposes no order minimums, aiming to reduce lead times and simplify supply chains for both established manufacturers and first-time product developers.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Plastic Injection Molding", "CAD Design", "3D Printing (Rapid Prototyping)", "Production Molding", "Assembly", "Packaging", "Metal-to-Plastic Conversion", "Product Development", "Renderings and Animations", "Drop Shipping"], "industries": ["Consumer Goods", "Medical", "Military", "Industrial", "Original Equipment Manufacturers"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "No minimums or maximums; from one part to millions of parts", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["All services in-house: CAD design, mold making, molding, assembly, packaging, and shipping", "No minimum or maximum order quantities", "Same-business-day quote response", "Metal-to-plastic conversion expertise", "3D printing for rapid prototyping"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1976 -> db", "Headquarters Bradenton, Florida -> db, /, /about-us", "Plastic injection molding and full-service product development -> /, /about-us", "No minimum or maximum order quantities -> /, /about-us", "Volumes from one part to millions -> /, /about-us", "In-house CAD design, mold making, molding, assembly, packaging -> /about-us", "3D printing for rapid prototyping -> /, /about-us", "Metal-to-plastic conversion -> /, /about-us", "Industries: consumer goods, medical, military, industrial, other manufacturers -> /about-us", "Works with inventors and entrepreneurs for new product development -> /", "Same-business-day quote response -> /", "Downloadable NDA available -> /", "Global client base -> /, /about-us", "Renderings and animations for design validation -> /about-u