UPDATE companies SET description='DINGXIN AUTO PARTS is based in New Castle, Delaware. The company was founded in 2015 and has since focused on the research, development, and production of automotive stamping parts and exterior accessories. It operates its own factory and warehouse, and also functions as a trader offering one-stop procurement for a wide range of vehicle components.

