UPDATE companies SET description='Daniels Manufacturing Corporation (DMC) was founded in 1947 by Bill Daniels in Pontiac, Michigan, and incorporated in 1949 in Bloomfield Hills, Michigan. The company established its headquarters in Orlando, Florida, in 1984 following a merger with Balmar. DMC is a veteran-owned small business that emphasizes a family culture and has been producing tooling for mission-critical electrical systems for over 75 years.

DMC designs and manufactures precision crimp tools, tool kits, connector assembly tools, Safe-T-Cable® systems, wire preparation tools, and LaceLok® wire harness supports. The company also provides custom tooling solutions, taking projects from concept through design, testing, and manufacturing in its Orlando facility, which houses CNC milling and turning machines, EDM equipment, dual-axis CNC live tooling, and precision grinders. Many of its tools are listed on the Department of Defense Qualified Products List (QPL) and are manufactured in the United States.

DMC serves a broad range of industries, including government (ground, naval, aviation, space), aviation (OEM, MRO, eVTOL, rotorcraft, commercial and executive airlines, drones), space (satellites, launch vehicles, space station), medical (devices and equipment), telecommunications (military and hardened networks, RF wireless), automotive (OEM, service/repair, motorsport, off-highway), rail (wayside, locomotive), power generation (hydro, solar, wind, natural gas, nuclear), and automation (mining, manufacturing, robotics).

The company differentiates itself through a nationwide team of tooling experts who visit customer facilities, active participation in industry standards associations, and a commitment to custom solutions built in-house. DMC’s quality management system is certified to AS9100D and ISO 9001:2015 by NSF-ISR, and its veteran-owned, small-business status underscores a focus on precision, dependability, and long-term customer relationships.', certifications=ARRAY['AS9100D','ISO 9001:2015','MIL-SPEC']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["CNC milling", "CNC turning", "EDM", "precision grinding", "custom tooling design", "tool manufacturing", "testing", "precision crimp tool production", "tool kit assembly", "connector assembly tooling", "Safe-T-Cable manufacturing", "wire preparation tooling", "LaceLok manufacturing", "tensile test equipment manufacturing", "backshell tooling", "pneumatic crimp tool manufacturing", "pneumatic wire stripper manufacturing", "large gauge crimping", "battery-powered crimp tool manufacturing", "adjustable stripping tool for twisted shielded cable"], "industries": ["Government", "Aviation", "Space", "Medical", "Telecommunications", "Automotive", "Rail", "Power Generation", "Automation", "Marine"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["CNC milling machines", "CNC turning machines", "EDM", "dual-axis CNC live tooling", "precision grinders"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Nationwide field experts who visit customer facilities for on-site support", "Active contributors to leading industry standards associations", "Custom tooling from concept through design, testing, and manufacturing in-house", "Tools manufactured in the U.S. with many on the DoD Qualified Products List", "Veteran-owned small business with AS9100D and ISO 9001:2015 certification"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1947 by Bill Daniels in Pontiac, Michigan -> /about", "Incorporated 1949 in Bloomfield Hills, Michigan -> /about", "Headquarters moved to Orlando, Florida 