UPDATE companies SET description='Defiant Food Group operates from Richmond, Virginia, where it develops and produces ready-to-serve proteins for foodservice, institutional, and retail channels. The company was founded to address gaps in nutrition, food distribution, and supply-chain sustainability, though a specific founding year and founder names are not publicly disclosed.

