UPDATE companies SET description='Delta Systems Inc. was founded in 1972 in Streetsboro, Ohio, when the company began making parts for outdoor power equipment. Rather than outsourcing critical operations, the founders chose to keep production in-house to maintain control over quality and safety.

The company designs and manufactures electronic components—switches, controllers, displays, and sensors—for equipment that demands safety and durability in harsh environments. Its vertically integrated Streetsboro plant houses electronics manufacturing, plastic injection molding, design engineering, assembly, value analysis, and tooling under one roof, allowing end-to-end control from concept to finished product.

Delta serves original equipment manufacturers in outdoor power equipment, utility vehicles, agriculture, and light industrial markets.

