UPDATE companies SET description='DiLanna Foodservice and Paper Products operates from Johnston, Rhode Island, where it was founded in 1939 as a family-owned business. Now in its fourth generation, the company continues under the leadership of David DiLanna, who has maintained a practice of hiring local residents and preserving the family-oriented approach that defined its early years.

The company distributes a broad range of foodservice and paper products, including canned and dry goods, meat and poultry, dairy and frozen items, paper products and packaging, convenience foods, grocery staples, and specialty seasonal items. Its catalog expands daily, and orders are fulfilled through direct delivery across Rhode Island and into southeastern Massachusetts, supported by a mobile app that provides access to personalized order guides.

DiLanna serves restaurants and full-service dining establishments, pizzerias, convenience stores, grocery stores, nursing homes and healthcare facilities, and other institutional accounts. The customer base spans neighborhood eateries in Providence to large institutional operations on the South Shore.

The business emphasizes personal service and reliability, with a team led by industry veterans such as Director of Sales Anthony Melillo, who brings more than 30 years of hands-on experience from dishwasher to chef and food-and-beverage manager. The company positions its differentiator as answering the phone personally, delivering dependably, and treating customers like family.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Foodservice distribution", "Paper products distribution", "Direct delivery", "Catalog management", "Mobile ordering platform", "Account management"], "industries": ["Restaurants & full-service dining", "Pizzerias", "Convenience stores", "Grocery stores", "Nursing homes & healthcare facilities", "Institutional accounts"], "materials": ["Canned goods", "Dry grocery", "Meat & poultry", "Dairy", "Frozen foods", "Paper products", "Packaging", "Produce", "Convenience foods", "Specialty & seasonal items"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned since 1939, now in fourth generation", "Direct delivery throughout Rhode Island and southeastern Massachusetts", "Leadership with 30+ years of kitchen and management experience", "Mobile app for catalog access and personalized ordering", "Personal phone support and family-style customer service"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1939, family-owned, fourth generation -> /about-us", "Headquartered in Johnston, Rhode Island -> /about-us, /", "David DiLanna continues hiring local residents -> /about-us", "Distributes canned/dry goods, meat/poultry, dairy/frozen, paper products, packaging, convenience foods, grocery staples, specialty/seasonal -> /services, /", "Direct delivery throughout Rhode Island and southeastern Massachusetts -> /about-us, /", "Mobile app for catalog access and personalized ordering -> /, /about-us", "Serves restaurants, pizzerias, convenience stores, grocery stores, nursing homes, institutional accounts -> /, /about-us, /services", "A