UPDATE companies SET description='Diagnostic Medical Equipment Inc. was founded in 2011 in Moore, Oklahoma. The company is led by CEO Arun Mirchia and operates from a facility on Messenger Lane. With over 15 years of expertise in healthcare, the firm has built a reputation for mutual service and efficient delivery.

The firm distributes GE Healthcare ultrasound systems, carrying the Voluson, Logiq, and Vivid product lines. It claims to hold the largest inventory of GE ultrasounds in the United States and provides global shipping and crating services. A 24/7 support team handles inquiries and logistics for customers worldwide. The inventory is constantly updated to reflect the latest equipment from GE.

Customers include hospitals, polyclinics, health centers, and laboratories across multiple countries. The company also works with biomedical engineers and medical professionals seeking diagnostic imaging equipment. Its client base spans globally, with a focus on healthcare institutions requiring advanced ultrasound technology. The team includes medical advisors such as Dr. Louis Peters, a dermatologist, and Dr. Robert Napper, a family physician.

