UPDATE companies SET description='DiaMed, Inc. is based in Windham, Maine, and has specialized in antibody products since its founding in 1983. Founded in 1983, the company has maintained a narrow focus on antibody technologies, building a service portfolio that spans from early-stage research support to larger-scale production.

The company provides contract antibody services including purification, conjugation, and modification tailored to customer specifications. It operates at scales ranging from research-size batches to bulk production, and also offers custom buffer formulation and concentration adjustment. DiaMed also sells excess conjugated antibody material from previous runs at reduced cost, and assists clients during product development by manufacturing research-scale batches of purified, labeled, and modified antibodies. The firm notes that its services can be scaled in accordance with client needs, whether for bulk amounts or research-scale batches.

The company serves organizations engaged in antibody-based research and product development, providing research-scale manufacturing support for purified, labeled, and modified antibodies. It also supplies excess conjugated antibody inventory to buyers seeking cost-effective reagents. DiaMed''s customer base includes those developing new products who require assistance during the development process.

DiaMed highlights its scalable service model, its ability to adjust final product concentration and buffer systems to client requirements, and its focus on antibody-specific expertise developed over decades. The company states that it has specialized in antibody products since 1983, emphasizing its long-standing experience in the field.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Antibody purification", "Antibody conjugation", "Antibody modification", "Research-scale antibody manufacturing", "Custom buffer formulation", "Custom concentration adjustment", "Excess conjugated antibody inventory sales"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Research scale to bulk amounts", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Scalable antibody services from research to bulk scale", "Custom buffer and concentration specifications", "Economic pricing on excess conjugated antibody inventory", "Research-scale manufacturing for product development", "Decades of antibody specialization since 1983"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1983 -> db", "Headquarters Windham, Maine -> db", "Specializes in antibody products since 1983 -> pages:/", "Services: purify, conjugate, modify antibodies to specifications -> pages:/", "Scalable from research scale to bulk amounts -> pages:/", "Custom buffer formulation and concentration adjustment -> pages:/", "Sells excess conjugated antibody material from prior batches -> pages:/", "Assists in product development with research-scale manufacturing -> pages:/"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We can purify, conjugate and modify antibodies to your specifications. Whether you need bulk amounts or research scale batches, our services can be scaled in accordance with your needs.", "founded_year": "1983", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, update