UPDATE companies SET description='Drummond Industries Inc. was founded in 1968 in Bensenville, Illinois, just outside Chicago’s O’Hare Airport. The company has remained family-owned since its inception and is currently led by President Matthew Gieser. Over five decades, it has grown from a local molder into a regional supplier of custom plastic components.

The 50,000-square-foot facility houses 20 injection molding machines supported by an in-house tool room and auxiliary equipment. Operations run 24 hours a day, five days a week, producing parts ranging from prototype quantities of 250 pieces to high-volume runs exceeding one million. Core processes include plastic injection molding, insert molding, overmolding, ultrasonic welding, part assembly, packaging, and in-house hot-stamp decoration. The shop also offers prototyping, new-product development assistance, and customer warehousing.

Drummond serves medical-device and automotive customers in the Chicagoland area. The company works with businesses of all sizes, from startups needing prototypes to established manufacturers seeking production support.

President Matthew Gieser summarizes the firm’s philosophy: “I know that Drummond’s reputation is only as good as its last shipment.” The company emphasizes on-time delivery, close communication, and a partnership approach that extends beyond molding to include assembly, decoration, and inventory management.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Plastic Injection Molding", "Insert Molding", "Overmolding", "Ultrasonic Welding", "Part Assembly", "Packaging", "Hot Stamping (Plastic Part Decoration)", "Prototyping", "Customer Warehousing", "In-House Tool Room", "New Product Development Assistance"], "industries": ["Medical Devices", "Automotive"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "250 to 1,000,000+ parts", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["24-hour manufacturing, 5 days a week", "In-house tool room for mold maintenance and development", "Hot-stamp decoration performed in-house", "Customer warehousing and inventory management", "Family-owned continuity since 1968"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1968 -> db", "Family-owned since 1968 -> /", "Headquarters Bensenville, Illinois -> /", "50,000 sq ft facility -> /", "20 injection molding machines -> /", "In-house tool room -> /", "24/5 operation -> /", "Volume range 250 to 1,000,000+ -> /about", "Medical devices and automotive examples -> /", "President Matthew Gieser quote -> /", "Services: injection molding, insert molding, overmolding, ultrasonic welding, assembly, decoration, warehousing -> /", "Hot stamping done in-house -> /", "Customer warehousing -> /", "Prototyping and new product development assistance -> /about"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Drummond Industries is Chicagolands premier choice in custom injection molding.", "founded_year": "1968", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, up